      "writtenOn": "2020-06-02T20:11:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "grepping for ASSERT_EC_RST shows that it is used in another place. \n\nAlso, Mary brought up a good point: what I wrote earlier\n\n\"EC reset is also pulsed when power+refresh are pressed (even though it is asserted again by the RO and deasserted by rbox_release_ec_reset()).\"\n\nis incorrect, The deassertion happens only on H1 cold starts, not on resume from deep sleep  neither when the operator presses power+refresh.\n\nWithout periodic ec reset reinforcement pressing power+refresh would reboot the device.",
